nteractions, diversity of behaviors, diversity of connections.", "tokens": [51395, 36188, 286, 12213, 11, 9573, 286, 14301, 11, 9573, 286, 8787, 13, 51701], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14461729560099856, "compression_ratio": 1.7291666666666667, "no_speech_prob": 0.006196205038577318}, {"id": 36, "seek": 22232, "start": 222.32, "end": 228.12, "text": " And when you watch bonobo play, you're seeing the very evolutionary roots of human laughter,", "tokens": [50363, 843, 618, 345, 2342, 5351, 20391, 711, 11, 345, 821, 4379, 262, 845, 16673, 11135, 286, 1692, 20263, 11, 50653], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1907333775570518, "compression_ratio": 1.4678899082568808, "no_speech_prob": 0.023066073656082153}, {"id": 37, "seek": 22232, "start": 228.12, "end": 231.32, "text": " dance, and ritual.", "tokens": [50653, 9280, 11, 290, 12146, 13, 50813], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1907333775570518, "compression_ratio": 1.4678899082568808, "no_speech_prob": 0.023066073656082153}, {"id": 38, "seek": 22232, "start": 231.32, "end": 234.48, "text": " Play is the glue that binds us together.", "tokens": [50813, 3811, 318, 262, 22749, 326, 37354, 514, 1978, 13, 50971], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1907333775570518, "compression_ratio": 1.4678899082568808, "no_speech_prob": 0.023066073656082153}, {"id": 39, "seek": 22232, "start": 234.48, "end": 241.04, "text": " Now, I don't know how you play, but I want to show you a couple of unique clips, fresh", "tokens": [50971, 2735, 11, 314, 836, 470, 760, 703, 345, 711, 11, 475, 314, 765, 284, 905, 345, 257, 3155, 286, 3748, 19166, 11, 4713, 51299], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1907333775570518, "compression_ratio": 1.4678899082568808, "no_speech_prob": 0.023066073656082153}, {"id": 40, "seek": 22232, "start": 241.04, "end": 242.04, "text": " from the wild.", "tokens": [51299, 422, 262, 4295, 13, 51349], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1907333775570518, "compression_ratio": 1.4678899082568808, "no_speech_prob": 0.023066073656082153}, {"id": 41, "seek": 22232, "start": 242.04, "end": 245.56, "text": " First, it's a ballgame, bonobo style.", "tokens": [51349, 3274, 11, 340, 338, 257, 2613, 6057, 11, 5351, 20391, 3918, 13, 51525], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1907333775570518, "compression_ratio": 1.4678899082568808, "no_speech_prob": 0.023066073656082153}, {"id": 42, "seek": 22232, "start": 245.56, "end": 248.0, "text": " And I do not mean football.", "tokens": [51525, 843, 314, 466, 407, 1612, 4346, 13, 51647], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1907333775570518, "compression_ratio": 1.4678899082568808, "no_speech_prob": 0.023066073656082153}, {"id": 43, "seek": 24800, "start": 248.0, "end": 254.56, "text": " So here, we have a young female and a male engaged in a chase game.", "tokens": [50363, 1406, 994, 11, 356, 423, 257, 1862, 4048, 290, 257, 4257, 7953, 287, 257, 15505, 983, 13, 50691], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21146306537446521, "compression_ratio": 1.484375, "no_speech_prob": 0.002877499209716916}, {"id": 44, "seek": 24800, "start": 254.56, "end": 256.66, "text": " Have a look what she's doing.", "tokens": [50691, 8192, 257, 804, 644, 673, 338, 1804, 13, 50796], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21146306537446521, "compression_ratio": 1.484375, "no_speech_prob": 0.002877499209716916}, {"id": 45, "seek": 24800, "start": 256.66, "end": 261.6, "text": " It might be the evolutionary origin of the phrase, she's got him by the balls.", "tokens": [50796, 632, 1244, 307, 262, 16673, 8159, 286, 262, 9546, 11, 673, 338, 1392, 683, 416, 262, 11333, 13, 51043], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21146306537446521, "compression_ratio": 1.484375, "no_speech_prob": 0.002877499209716916}, {"id": 46, "seek": 24800, "start": 261.6, "end": 268.76, "text": " Only that I think he's rather loving it here, right?", "tokens": [51043, 5514, 326, 314, 892, 339, 338, 2138, 14442, 340, 994, 11, 826, 30, 51401], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21146306537446521, "compression_ratio": 1.484375, "no_speech_prob": 0.002877499209716916}, {"id": 47, "seek": 24800, "start": 268.76, "end": 271.76, "text": " Yeah.", "tokens": [51401, 9425, 13, 51551], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21146306537446521, "compression_ratio": 1.484375, "no_speech_prob": 0.002877499209716916}, {"id": 48, "seek": 24800, "start": 271.76, "end": 276.28, "text": " So sex play is common in both bonobos and humans.", "tokens": [51551, 1406, 1714, 711, 318, 2219, 287, 1111, 5351, 49878, 290, 5384, 13, 51777], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21146306537446521, "compression_ratio": 1.484375, "no_speech_prob": 0.002877499209716916}, {"id": 49, "seek": 27628, "start": 276.28, "end": 285.4, "text": " And this video is really interesting because it shows the inventiveness of bringing unusual", "tokens": [50363, 843, 428, 2008, 318, 1107, 3499, 780, 340, 2523, 262, 8067, 6517, 286, 6079, 8468, 50819], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17928533734015697, "compression_ratio": 1.4967741935483871, "no_speech_prob": 0.007878465577960014}, {"id": 50, "seek": 27628, "start": 285.4, "end": 293.47999999999996, "text": " elements into play, such as testicles, and also how play both requires trust and fosters", "tokens": [50819, 4847, 656, 711, 11, 884, 355, 1332, 2983, 11, 290, 635, 703, 711, 1111, 4433, 3774, 290, 26546, 364, 51223], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17928533734015697, "compression_ratio": 1.4967741935483871, "no_speech_prob": 0.007878465577960014}, {"id": 51, "seek": 27628, "start": 293.47999999999996, "end": 298.35999999999996, "text": " trust, while at the same time being tremendous fun.", "tokens": [51223, 3774, 11, 981, 379, 262, 976, 640, 852, 12465, 1257, 13, 51467], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17928533734015697, "compression_ratio": 1.4967741935483871, "no_speech_prob": 0.007878465577960014}, {"id": 52, "seek": 29836, "start": 298.36, "end": 309.84000000000003, "text": " But play is a shape-shifter, and it can take many forms, some of which are more quiet,", "tokens": [50363, 887, 711, 318, 257, 5485, 12, 1477, 18171, 11, 290, 340, 460, 1011, 867, 5107, 11, 617, 286, 543, 389, 517, 5897, 11, 50937], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19045674523641898, "compression_ratio": 1.4862385321100917, "no_speech_prob": 0.2550101578235626}, {"id": 53, "seek": 29836, "start": 309.84000000000003, "end": 314.44, "text": " imaginative, curious, maybe where wonder is discovered anew.", "tokens": [50937, 41138, 11, 11040, 11, 3863, 810, 4240, 318, 5071, 44951, 13, 51167], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19045674523641898, "compression_ratio": 1.4862385321100917, "no_speech_prob": 0.2550101578235626}, {"id": 54, "seek": 29836, "start": 314.44, "end": 320.36, "text": " And I want you to see, this is Fuku, a young female, and she's quietly playing with water.", "tokens": [51167, 843, 314, 765, 345, 284, 766, 11, 428, 318, 22431, 84, 11, 257, 1862, 4048, 11, 290, 673, 338, 12703, 2712, 351, 1660, 13, 51463], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19045674523641898, "compression_ratio": 1.4862385321100917, "no_speech_prob": 0.2550101578235626}, {"id": 55, "seek": 29836, "start": 320.36, "end": 325.76, "text": " I think like her, we sometimes play alone, and we explore the boundaries of our inner", "tokens": [51463, 314, 892, 588, 607, 11, 356, 3360, 711, 3436, 11, 290, 356, 7301, 262, 13215, 286, 674, 8434, 51733], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19045674523641898, "compression_ratio": 1.4862385321100917, "no_speech_prob": 0.2550101578235626}, {"id": 56, "seek": 32576, "start": 325.76, "end": 328.84, "text": " and our outer worlds.", "tokens": [50363, 290, 674, 12076, 11621, 13, 50517], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12953625005834243, "compression_ratio": 1.5674157303370786, "no_speech_prob": 0.9192408919334412}, {"id": 57, "seek": 32576, "start": 328.84, "end": 334.68, "text": " And it's that playful curiosity that drives us to explore, drives us to interact.", "tokens": [50517, 843, 340, 338, 326, 34264, 20136, 326, 10182, 514, 284, 7301, 11, 10182, 514, 284, 9427, 13, 50809], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12953625005834243, "compression_ratio": 1.5674157303370786, "no_speech_prob": 0.9192408919334412}, {"id": 58, "seek": 32576, "start": 334.68, "end": 341.86, "text": " And then the unexpected connections we form are the real hotbed for creativity.", "tokens": [50809, 843, 788, 262, 10059, 8787, 356, 1296, 389, 262, 1103, 3024, 3077, 329, 16389, 13, 51168], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12953625005834243, "compression_ratio": 1.5674157303370786, "no_speech_prob": 0.9192408919334412}, {"id": 59, "seek": 32576, "start": 341.86, "end": 349.52, "text": " So these are just small tasters into the insights that bonobos give us to our past and present.", "tokens": [51168, 1406, 777, 389, 655, 1402, 256, 7060, 656, 262, 17218, 326, 5351, 49878, 1577, 514, 284, 674, 1613, 290, 1944, 13, 51551], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.12953625005834243, "compression_ratio": 1.5674157303370786, "no_speech_prob": 0.9192408919334412}, {"id": 60, "seek": 34952, "start": 349.52, "end": 356.0, "text": " But they also hold a secret for our future, a future where we need to adapt to an increasingly", "tokens": [50363, 887, 484, 635, 1745, 257, 3200, 329, 674, 2003, 11, 257, 2003, 810, 356, 761, 284, 6068, 284, 281, 6481, 50687], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11680998983262461, "compression_ratio": 1.702020202020202, "no_speech_prob": 0.18228904902935028}, {"id": 61, "seek": 34952, "start": 356.0, "end": 361.56, "text": " challenging world through greater creativity and greater cooperation.", "tokens": [50687, 9389, 995, 832, 3744, 16389, 290, 3744, 11113, 13, 50965], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11680998983262461, "compression_ratio": 1.702020202020202, "no_speech_prob": 0.18228904902935028}, {"id": 62, "seek": 34952, "start": 361.56, "end": 367.03999999999996, "text": " The secret is that play is the key to these capacities.", "tokens": [50965, 383, 3200, 318, 326, 711, 318, 262, 1994, 284, 777, 32484, 13, 51239], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11680998983262461, "compression_ratio": 1.702020202020202, "no_speech_prob": 0.18228904902935028}, {"id": 63, "seek": 34952, "start": 367.03999999999996, "end": 371.24, "text": " In other words, play is our adaptive wild card.", "tokens": [51239, 554, 584, 2456, 11, 711, 318, 674, 29605, 4295, 2657, 13, 51449], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11680998983262461, "compression_ratio": 1.702020202020202, "no_speech_prob": 0.18228904902935028}, {"id": 64, "seek": 34952, "start": 371.24, "end": 378.71999999999997, "text": " In order to adapt successfully to a changing world, we need to play.", "tokens": [51449, 554, 1502, 284, 6068, 7675, 284, 257, 5609, 995, 11, 356, 761, 284, 711, 13, 51823], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11680998983262461, "compression_ratio": 1.702020202020202, "no_speech_prob": 0.18228904902935028}, {"id": 65, "seek": 37872, "start": 378.72, "end": 382.36, "text": " But will we make the most of our playfulness?", "tokens": [50363, 887, 481, 356, 787, 262, 749, 286, 674, 711, 15538, 30, 50545], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1283745069182321, "compression_ratio": 1.5363636363636364, "no_speech_prob": 0.007994081825017929}, {"id": 66, "seek": 37872, "start": 382.36, "end": 386.44000000000005, "text": " Play is not frivolous, play is essential.", "tokens": [50545, 3811, 318, 407, 48461, 11, 711, 318, 6393, 13, 50749], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1283745069182321, "compression_ratio": 1.5363636363636364, "no_speech_prob": 0.007994081825017929}, {"id": 67, "seek": 37872, "start": 386.44000000000005, "end": 391.76000000000005, "text": " For bonobos and humans alike, life is not just red in tooth and claw.", "tokens": [50749, 1114, 5351, 49878, 290, 5384, 12936, 11, 1204, 318, 407, 655, 2266, 287, 16162, 290, 26573, 13, 51015], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1283745069182321, "compression_ratio": 1.5363636363636364, "no_speech_prob": 0.007994081825017929}, {"id": 68, "seek": 37872, "start": 391.76000000000005, "end": 396.6, "text": " In times when it seems least appropriate to play, it might be the times when it's most", "tokens": [51015, 554, 1661, 618, 340, 2331, 1551, 5035, 284, 711, 11, 340, 1244, 307, 262, 1661, 618, 340, 338, 749, 51257], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1283745069182321, "compression_ratio": 1.5363636363636364, "no_speech_prob": 0.007994081825017929}, {"id": 69, "seek": 37872, "start": 396.6, "end": 398.74, "text": " urgent.", "tokens": [51257, 18039, 13, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1283745069182321, "compression_ratio": 1.5363636363636364, "no_speech_prob": 0.007994081825017929}, {"id": 70, "seek": 37872, "start": 398.74, "end": 407.22, "text": " And so, my fellow primates, let us embrace this gift from evolution and play together", "tokens": [51364, 843, 523, 11, 616, 5891, 41316, 11, 1309, 514, 12553, 428, 6979, 422, 6954, 290, 711, 1978, 51788], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1283745069182321, "compression_ratio": 1.5363636363636364, "no_speech_prob": 0.007994081825017929}, {"id": 71, "seek": 40722, "start": 407.22, "end": 412.20000000000005, "text": " as we rediscover creativity, fellowship, and wonder.", "tokens": [50363, 355, 356, 2266, 29392, 16389, 11, 37900, 11, 290, 4240, 13, 50612], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2422606819554379, "compression_ratio": 0.9402985074626866, "no_speech_prob": 0.8618798851966858}, {"id": 72, "seek": 40722, "start": 412.20000000000005, "end": 412.70000000000005, "text": " Thank you.", "tokens": [50612, 6952, 345, 13, 50637], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2422606819554379, "compression_ratio": 0.9402985074626866, "no_speech_prob": 0.8618798851966858}], "language": "en"}